<tr>
<td>데이터 계약·window</td>
<td style="text-align: right;">20</td>
<td>horizon/window 잘못 대응</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>validation·누수</td>
<td style="text-align: right;">20</td>
<td>random overlapping split, 전체 scaler fit</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>첫 baseline</td>
<td style="text-align: right;">10</td>
